- `ttnn.deallocate(args_0, False)` at the old line 251 (input_ids).
- `ttnn.deallocate(args_1, False)` at the old line 1403 (layer-0 cumulative_length).
- `ttnn.deallocate(args_attn, False)` at the old line 2676 (layers-1..15 cumulative_length, hit each iteration of the decoder-layer loop).

